{"title":"Multicolor Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAll About King of Christmas Multicolor Pre-Lit Trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eShop multicolor artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas to enjoy the best of both worlds. Designed with advanced lighting technology, these trees allow you to switch between classic warm white lights and vibrant multicolor displays all on a single tree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you prefer a timeless, elegant look or a more playful and festive atmosphere, multicolor trees offer the flexibility to customize your holiday décor with ease.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a multicolor Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas multicolor pre-lit artificial Christmas trees feature built-in lights capable of displaying both warm white and multicolor lighting options. Unlike standard pre-lit trees with a single light style, multicolor trees offer multiple lighting modes, allowing you to change the look of your tree with the touch of a button. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThese trees are designed to provide flexibility throughout the holiday season, making it easy to switch between a classic, warm white glow and a more vibrant display. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a multicolor artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eMulticolor artificial Christmas trees are ideal for those who want versatility in their holiday décor. With the ability to switch between warm white and multicolor lights, you can create multiple looks with a single tree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChoose warm white lighting for a more traditional, elegant feel, or switch to multicolor. This flexibility makes multicolor trees a great option for families, entertaining, or anyone who enjoys that nostalgic Christmas tree with colored lights. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eCan you switch between warm white and multicolor lights?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYes, multicolor artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas are designed to easily switch between warm white and multicolor lighting modes. With simple controls, you can adjust your tree’s lighting at any time, allowing you to transition from a classic look to a more colorful display in seconds.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat remote functions do King of Christmas multicolor trees offer?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur multicolor pre-lit trees offer functions including: Steady On, Slow Flash Warm White, Slow Fade Warm White, Steady Multi-Color, Slow Flash Multi-Color, Slow Fade Warm White \u0026amp; Multi-Color. Each remote is equipped with a dimmer and timer. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur latest collection of LuxeLED pre-lit Christmas trees features advanced lighting technology, including expanded multicolor and pastel lighting options for even greater customization.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBring your holiday vision to life with a multicolor artificial Christmas tree that adapts to every moment of the season. Whether you're decorating for a cozy night in or hosting a festive gathering, the ability to switch between warm white and multicolor lighting gives you complete control over your holiday ambiance. Explore King of Christmas multicolor pre-lit trees to find a high-quality, beautifully designed centerpiece that delivers both versatility and lasting holiday magic year after year.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 850 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642923741248,"sku":"RF-T6.5-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_20f68d8d-c632-40c6-9197-a0d56de53b1b.png?v=1722013184"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642924134464,"sku":"RF-T7.5-L","price":1199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_187ca423-b95a-4973-81ad-b9b24bddb079.png?v=1722013181"},{"product_id":"9-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1200 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642924429376,"sku":"RF-T9-L","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_3795bea1-b24d-43e1-8cc9-89c11c4dcfc5.png?v=1722013200"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642924953664,"sku":"RFS-T6.5-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD",