ith 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128138555592,"sku":"QF-T7.5-LUX","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_QueenFlockArtificialChristmasTreeLux.jpg?v=1782848477"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-lux-led","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 2000 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128139866312,"sku":"KNF-T7-LUX","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7_KingNobleFirLuxLED.jpg?v=1782849139"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-douglas-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Douglas Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes 